        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            StoneTech BulletProof is a well-made water-based impregnating sealer from LATICRETE, now without intentionally added PFAS, rated for marble, porous stone and grout, inside and out. The data sheet is clear about its limits: up to five years indoors in good conditions, annual reapplication for best results, and no protection against etching.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Choose it over 511 Impregnator when odor, ventilation or flammability matter. Choose 511 when you want faster light use and have the ventilation for solvent. Either way, test first, wipe off every bit of excess, and let the water test, not the name on the bottle, decide when to reseal.
          </p>
